{"Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001B3A": "「イグニス……さすがに……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001B68": "「アクイラ、僕はまだ……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001B93": "「コンターギオ……僕はまだ戦う……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001BCD": "「ウンブラ……僕は退かない……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001BFE": "「ペルフェクティオ……/　その呪縛、断ち切ってみせる！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001C51": "「くうっ！　負の波動が増している……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001C8E": "「まだこのくらいなら……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001CB6": "「ここで退くわけにはいかない」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001CE4": "「戦ってみせる……僕も……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001D12": "「くっ、強い……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001D31": "「やる……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001D47": "「この程度の攻撃で……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001D6C": "「これなら大丈夫だ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001D8B": "「その程度でやられはしない」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001DB6": "「このダメージなら、問題ない」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001DE4": "「僕を狙ってきたか……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001E09": "「僕は……お前達の所には戻らない……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001E46": "「お前達でも……/　僕の意志を曲げることは出来ない」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001E93": "「それを受けるわけにはいかない」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001EC4": "「そんなもので」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001EDD": "「ストゥディウムなら、かわせる」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001F0E": "「以前の僕とは違うんだ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001F33": "「もうその呪縛には……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001F58": "「ストゥディウムには通用しない」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001F89": "「僕を止めるつもりなら……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001FB4": "「ペルフェクティオ……僕は抗う……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x001FEE": "「その攻撃は効かないんだ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x002016": "「無駄だよ。この機体には効かない」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x00204A": "「それは無効化できる」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x00206C": "「………」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x00207C": "「反撃は……無理か」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x00209B": "「何とかしのぐしかない……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x0020C9": "「これでは……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x0020E2": "「後は任せて」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x0020F8": "「僕の力も……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x002114": "「僕も行く……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x002130": "「力になるよ、リム」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x00214F": "「リム、後は僕が」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x00216B": "「協力するよ、ジョッシュ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x002193": "「ラキ、後は僕がやる」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x0021B5": "「ここは僕が……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x0021D4": "「ストゥディウムで受け止める……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x00220B": "「させるものか……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x00222D": "「逃げるんだ、リム」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x00224C": "「リムを守ってみせる……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x002277": "「ジョッシュ、君は退避を」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x00229F": "「ラキ、君は下がって」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x0022C1": "「まだ行ける……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x0022E0": "「もう一度……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x0022FC": "「撃つよ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x00230C": "「外さない」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x00231F": "「当ててみせるよ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x00233B": "「命中させる」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x002351": "「ドラコの剣！　これで！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x002379": "「貫け、ストゥディウム！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x0023A1": "「飛べ、ストゥディウム」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x0023C6": "「これで！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x0023D9": "「行くよ、ストゥディウム」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x002401": "「この一撃で！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x00241A": "「僕は……風になる」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x002439": "「光よ、疾れ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/111.bmd|0x002452": "「逃がさない！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000B39": "「これが……僕の役目」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000B5B": "「務めを果たそう……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000B7D": "「何故、僕を呼ぶ？/　何故、意識の中に入ってくる？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000BCA": "「僕達の意識が、想いが共振している……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000C07": "「リム……二つの魂を持つ娘……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000C38": "「君の意識も感じる……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000C5D": "「意識は感じるが、共振はしない……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000C94": "「ジョッシュ、君は……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000CB9": "「これで僕は……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000CD8": "「そう、これで……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000CF7": "「くううっ……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000D13": "「まだ……足りない……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000D3B": "「迷う必要はない……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000D5D": "「僕を倒す気なら……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000D7F": "「そうだ……君なら僕を……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000DAD": "「君なら、僕の望みを……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000DD8": "「ううっ……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000DF1": "「直撃か……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000E07": "「まだだ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000E1D": "「もっと……確実に……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000E42": "「これも共振が成せる業なのか……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000E79": "「強く感じる……その存在を……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000EAD": "「強い意志だ……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000ECC": "「くっ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000EDF": "「当ててきたか……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000EFE": "「遠慮はいらない……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000F20": "「この程度……なのか」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000F42": "「意識が……引き寄せられているのか」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000F79": "「この感覚は……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000F95": "「触れ方が……違う」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000FB4": "「ここでは、まだ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000FD6": "「僕には……見えるんだ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x000FFB": "「その存在を強く感じる……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x001026": "「駄目だ……それじゃ、僕を……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x001057": "「………」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x001067": "「僕からも……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x001080": "「グラキエース、後は僕が」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x0010A8": "「僕に出来ることを……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x0010D0": "「グラキエース、ここは僕が引き受ける」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x00110A": "「まだ行ける……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x001129": "「もう一度……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x001145": "「撃つ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x001158": "「当てなければ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x001177": "「僕も戦わなければ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x00119C": "「ドラコの剣！　これで！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x0011C4": "「貫け、ストゥディウム！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x0011EC": "「飛べ、ストゥディウム」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x001211": "「これで！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x001224": "「行くよ、ストゥディウム」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x00124C": "「この一撃で！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x001265": "「僕は……風になる」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x001284": "「光よ、疾れ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/112.bmd|0x00129D": "「逃がさない！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/113.bmd|0x002471": "「邪魔はさせない」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/113.bmd|0x00248D": "「私が……落とす」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/113.bmd|0x0024A9": "「これが私の運命ならば……やってみせよう」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/113.bmd|0x0024E9": "「私は戦うために生まれたのだ。/　相手が何であろうと……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/113.bmd|0x002542": "「私はジョッシュ達の力になると決めた」"}